  description: '1 Tuner + 1+ non-Tuner "Gusto" monsters

    You can only Special
    Summon "Daigusto Laplampilica" once per turn. If this card is Synchro Summoned:
    You can Special Summon 1 "Gusto" monster from your hand and 1 "Gusto" monster
    from your Deck, but negate their effects, then immediately after this effect
    resolves, Synchro Summon 1 "Gusto" Synchro Monster using only those 2 monsters,
    also you cannot Special Summon monsters for the rest of this turn, except WIND
    monsters. Your opponent cannot target other "Gusto" Synchro Monsters you control
    with card effects.'
